      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mwmwtyh",
      "content": "• Kharif crops are sown with the onset of monsoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ypmlbxf",
      "content": "• Punjab and Haryana benefited most from Green Revolution."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
